~ 什么？然后给主人留张纸条？ ~ 好啊。
~ What, and then leave the owner
a note? ~ Yes.

146
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,670
再给点钱……我是说，这只是一根栅栏，
And a few dollar...
I mean it's a bit of fence,

147
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:13,230
~ 他可以把它重新竖起来。 
~ 哈蒙德，纸条写啥？
~ he could put that back up.
~ Hammond, what will the note say?

148
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:16,030
“抱歉我们撞坏了你的栅栏，让所有动物都跑掉了，
"Sorry we broke your fence
and let all your animals escape,

